WEBVTT

00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:12.630
I'm an idiot...

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:15.930
It was my idea to fight Avatars with Avatars...

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:19.160
I didn't even realize everyone was getting exhausted.

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:22.620
I fail as a captain!

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:27.330
The team can't win when I'm the captain!

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:28.960
Tenma!

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:31.840
Matsukaze Tenma!

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:42.290
Captain Shindou...

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:50.830
I don't qualify to be captain.

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:53.820
I couldn't bring out the best in everyone.

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.700
Tenma, I know you can do it.

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:58.410
I know you can.

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:01.430
Your weapon is in there!

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:04.410
Inside me...

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:07.880
The feelings of loving soccer?

00:01:14.690 --> 00:01:15.750
Feelings...

00:02:55.510 --> 00:02:57.480
Tenma, take a look.

00:03:05.710 --> 00:03:08.800
Is this the soccer you wanted to play?

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:10.770
The soccer I wanted to play...

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:23.680
No, this isn't it.

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:25.430
The soccer I want is...

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:28.240
<i>That was awesome, Shinsuke!{}</i>

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:31.140
<i>All right!</i>

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:35.110
The soccer I want is...!

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:38.030
You get it?

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:39.500
Yes, sir!

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:43.850
Sorry! I was wrong.

00:03:45.610 --> 00:03:51.270
If we want to bring back real soccer, we have to play with real soccer.

00:03:51.270 --> 00:03:53.730
Just like always. So...

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:55.460
Just like always, huh?

00:03:58.380 --> 00:03:59.760
Let's do it, Captain.

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:01.880
Kurama-senpai!

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:04.510
We're all prepared for it.

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:08.870
We want to play real soccer with you.

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:13.690
Our revolution started from your straightforward feelings.

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:15.980
Feelings...

00:04:18.640 --> 00:04:21.040
Bring out the best in everyone with my feelings!

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:27.700
The wind...

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:34.630
The Holy Road finals!

00:04:34.630 --> 00:04:37.850
We're past the halfway point in the second half of Raimon versus Seidouzan!

00:04:37.850 --> 00:04:40.490
At 4-2, Seidouzan has a 2-point lead!

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:48.860
Dragon Link is composed of children who were not given the chance to play soccer, despite their talent.

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:54.270
However, by providing them with the environment to play all of the soccer they desire,

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:58.140
their talents flourished and they've all become able to use Avatars.

00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:02.840
This is because Fifth Sector managed their soccer.

00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:07.020
They are the symbol of my managed soccer.

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:10.830
And now, that symbol is standing at the very peak.

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:14.510
They will prove that I am right.

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:17.370
All right!

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:21.100
Your enthusiasm won't take victory away from us.

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:24.630
It's a 2-point difference.

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:26.130
But...

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:31.950
With our real soccer, we'll...

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:35.020
We'll definitely win!

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:40.080
Raimon resumes the game with a kickoff!

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:44.790
Elite Soldier Pawn!

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:53.080
It's useless!

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:55.160
Elite Soldier Pawn!

00:06:02.410 --> 00:06:03.870
Demon Prime Minister Bishop!

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:05.380
Iron Horse Warrior Knight!

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:11.050
Don't you understand that it's useless?

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:12.020
I'm not done!

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:14.130
Witch Queen Lydia!

00:06:14.130 --> 00:06:15.260
Guardian Tower Rook!

00:06:21.970 --> 00:06:23.880
That should quiet you down.

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:36.450
The ball is stolen from Matsukaze!

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:39.670
Seidouzan turns the tables!

00:06:50.900 --> 00:06:54.490
No matter how many times he was beaten down, he kept standing up.

00:06:54.790 --> 00:07:00.530
When I saw Tenma like that back on the first day of school, I knew I just had to play soccer with him.

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:09.660
I'd gotten apathetic about putting effort into things somewhere down the line,

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:12.610
but before I knew it, I was getting passionate along with him.

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:19.530
He didn't have to do it.

00:07:19.530 --> 00:07:25.630
But seeing Tenma-kun face up to things I thought were
 troublesome made me join him before I'd even realized!

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:28.400
Godai!

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:34.410
Real soccer sure is great.

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:37.610
My entire body is happy about kicking the ball.

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:42.770
Your straightforward feelings let Shindou face soccer again seriously.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:47.840
When I'm with you, I'm filled with feelings of not wanting to give up!

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:52.740
With Tenma-kun, I can't help but feel like it's okay to trust him.

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:06.300
Four in Raimon work together to block the ball!

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:12.280
You're the one who made me remember the pure feelings I had towards soccer, Tenma!

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:16.790
Those desperate feelings as they chase the ball...

00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:18.740
Raimon's movements have changed.

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:20.060
It's as if...

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:24.810
There are eleven of Tenma.

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:30.030
Yes, your plays and feelings stir up the hearts of everyone.

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:31.220
They stir up a wind!

00:08:31.730 --> 00:08:33.380
The ball goes from Tsurugi to Matsukaze.

00:08:33.380 --> 00:08:35.860
And then to Nishiki and Kageyama!

00:08:35.860 --> 00:08:39.510
But the iron wall final defense line, Gomaki and Gouishi, stand in their way!

00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:42.500
Everyone worked hard to bring up this ball!

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:43.750
We won't let it go in vain!

00:08:56.310 --> 00:09:01.010
Extend Zone!

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:06.370
Kageyama's shoot has blown back the Avatars!

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:09.110
But that ball has lost its firepower.

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:11.630
No, this wasn't a shoot!

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:14.110
It was a pass to Matsukaze and Tsurugi!

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:18.520
The reason I'm able to be here is because you were there, Matsukaze.

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:20.750
No, because it was <i>you!</i>

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:21.410
Tenma!

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:28.240
We'll bring back real soccer!

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:32.370
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:09:35.350 --> 00:09:37.930
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:40.140
Tenma!

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:44.610
It's no use!

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:54.680
Wise Sovereign Kingburn!

00:09:57.150 --> 00:10:01.070
Fire Tornado Double Drive!

00:10:09.430 --> 00:10:11.320
King Fire!

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:14.070
What?!

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:15.550
This power...!

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:17.760
GO!

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:23.980
Goal!

00:10:23.980 --> 00:10:27.170
3-4! Raimon takes a point back!

00:10:27.170 --> 00:10:31.920
Raimon scores with the hissatsu technique Fire Tornado Double Drive!

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:37.650
It's the legendary shoot that Gouenji Shuuya used only once as a Japanese national!

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:39.590
A 2-person technique...

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:45.790
It's a hissatsu shoot that gets amplified from two people using Fire Tornado at the same time.

00:10:46.260 --> 00:10:52.240
It's a highly difficult technique that won't succeed if the two aren't perfectly synchronized with each other's movements.

00:10:52.680 --> 00:10:55.400
I never thought they'd come this far from that very first day they met!

00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:58.020
This is another power that soccer brings, isn't it?

00:10:58.550 --> 00:10:59.380
Kidou.

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:00.010
Yeah.

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:02.360
Tenma, Tsurugi...

00:11:02.360 --> 00:11:03.450
Those two...

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:08.650
For the while...

00:11:08.650 --> 00:11:10.150
We got a point...

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:15.150
You were the one who taught them.

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:17.740
Yes, but...

00:11:18.870 --> 00:11:20.570
<i>They</i>  are the ones who chose to accomplish it.

00:11:21.170 --> 00:11:22.530
I finally understand now.

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:31.150
I felt that you had strong feelings towards soccer on that day you came before me.

00:11:32.690 --> 00:11:37.250
However, you were not joining me for Fifth Sector's sake.

00:11:37.970 --> 00:11:41.830
You arranged this revolution from the inside in order to take back soccer.

00:11:42.270 --> 00:11:45.680
Ishido Shuuji... No, Gouenji Shuuya.

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:50.680
You left your seat on Japan's national team to become my servant.

00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:56.150
You threw away your status in the soccer world in order to sacrifice everything for the sake of soccer.

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:59.430
Soccer is my savior.

00:11:59.430 --> 00:12:02.720
Without soccer, I wouldn't be who I am today.

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:11.580
Everyone on the team back then had been saved by soccer.

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:16.630
But soccer as it is right now can't save anyone.

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:22.220
That's why I've decided to use any means necessary to take back soccer.

00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:26.090
So that is your truth?

00:12:26.990 --> 00:12:30.180
Use real soccer to defeat managed soccer.

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:37.400
I believe that is the only way to awaken everyone to the truth and save soccer.

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:42.040
I'm prepared to risk everything for that purpose.

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:46.870
You're not the only one who is risking everything.

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:53.160
Managed soccer is the righteous system that provides everyone an equal chance.

00:12:56.960 --> 00:12:58.450
Ichino, Aoyama!

00:12:58.450 --> 00:12:59.120
You're up!

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:00.210
Yes, sir!

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:04.560
Hey...

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:06.540
Take care of the rest.

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:08.430
You did great out there.

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:09.230
Yeah.

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:09.890
Leave it to us!

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:18.950
Hunter's Net!

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:22.780
What?

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:25.010
Tenma-kun!

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:29.870
You won't get past me!

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:32.450
Soyokaze Step!

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:37.350
This is...!

00:13:37.810 --> 00:13:39.330
Ichino-senpai!

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:41.760
Let's win this, Aoyama!

00:13:41.760 --> 00:13:43.000
Yeah, Ichino!

00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:50.290
Britannia Cross!

00:13:52.900 --> 00:13:56.760
Their hissatsu techniques are breaking past our Avatars?

00:13:57.030 --> 00:13:58.110
This can't be happening!

00:13:58.940 --> 00:13:59.680
Nishiki!

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:08.450
Denrai Houtou!

00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:15.620
Wise Sovereign Kingburn!

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:21.530
King Fire!

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:25.150
What?!

00:14:27.210 --> 00:14:28.420
Tied!

00:14:28.420 --> 00:14:31.940
Raimon finally catches up with Nishiki's goal!

00:14:31.940 --> 00:14:33.540
How could this be...

00:14:35.510 --> 00:14:38.100
Not only once, but twice!

00:14:39.430 --> 00:14:42.540
Dragon Link can't possibly lose!

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:43.690
It's not possible!

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:50.200
Raimon steals the ball and attacks again!

00:14:50.550 --> 00:14:51.170
Tsurugi!

00:14:57.400 --> 00:14:59.250
Death Drop!{G3~~~}

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:05.110
I won't let you stop my dad's ideal soccer!

00:15:05.110 --> 00:15:07.800
Wise Sovereign Kingburn!

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:12.310
Wait, Matsukaze is heading for it!

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:18.850
True Mach Wind!

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:20.200
A shoot chain!

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:24.750
This is our...

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:27.320
Real soccer!

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:29.780
King Fire!

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:34.040
Why?!

00:15:34.210 --> 00:15:36.680
Why are Avatar users like us...

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:38.430
...giving in to these people?!

00:15:43.160 --> 00:15:45.680
Goal! Raimon makes a comeback!

00:15:45.680 --> 00:15:49.500
Matsukaze and Tsurugi make in another goal!

00:15:50.150 --> 00:15:51.900
We did it!

00:15:54.910 --> 00:15:56.050
I see...

00:15:56.610 --> 00:15:58.600
So that's what it is.

00:16:00.510 --> 00:16:04.830
There's the long whistle! The match is over!

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:12.090
We won...

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:28.800
We did it!

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:33.460
The championship of the Holy Road Nationals goes to Raimon Jr. High!

00:16:33.890 --> 00:16:35.230
They won.

00:16:35.730 --> 00:16:36.980
Captain!

00:16:38.650 --> 00:16:41.470
I'm glad I joined Raimon.

00:16:41.470 --> 00:16:47.280
I'm glad that I got to meet you, Coach Endou and everyone, and play soccer with you all!

00:16:49.090 --> 00:16:49.690
Tenma...

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:51.370
Captain!

00:16:51.370 --> 00:16:54.380
Let's play soccer together again!

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:01.450
We will now commence with the award ceremony.

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:06.120
This year's Holy Road championship goes to Raimon Jr. High.

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:09.460
We won the championship.

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:13.980
We brought back real soccer!

00:17:23.940 --> 00:17:25.590
Isn't that great, Tenma?

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:26.370
Yeah!

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:28.100
I'm sure soccer is happy too.

00:17:28.430 --> 00:17:29.940
That again?

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:32.240
But it's <i>gotta</i>  be happy!

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:34.270
Sure, sure, whatever you say.

00:17:34.270 --> 00:17:35.920
It's happy!

00:17:36.270 --> 00:17:37.380
Right, Tsurugi?

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:39.290
Don't ask me.

00:17:40.520 --> 00:17:43.200
Then let's toss our captain up into the air!

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:44.070
Okay!

00:17:48.690 --> 00:17:50.720
Do you see the expressions on their faces?

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:51.880
Yeah.

00:17:52.610 --> 00:17:59.970
I'd forgotten the happiness that can only come from winning a fight after using your power to its limits.

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:03.950
Managed soccer wouldn't be able to produce that kind of expression.

00:18:04.870 --> 00:18:08.520
I intended to give everyone an equal chance to play,

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:11.120
but I ended up stealing that expression away.

00:18:12.660 --> 00:18:14.780
Where did I start going the wrong way?

00:18:16.720 --> 00:18:19.180
Soccer must surely be happy.

00:18:19.180 --> 00:18:20.450
Yes.

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:24.240
It has so many people loving it.

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:27.250
I love it as well.

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:29.620
Always have, and always will.

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:30.420
Yeah.

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:38.120
We will now present the results of the Holy Emperor election.

00:18:41.690 --> 00:18:47.390
Hibiki Seigou will be instated as the new Holy Emperor, the overseer of the soccer world!

00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:55.860
The new Holy Emperor, Hibiki Seigou, will now give his inaugural speech.

00:18:57.210 --> 00:19:00.610
Soccer is not an equal sport.

00:19:01.440 --> 00:19:07.470
Soccer is won through the desire to become stronger and the sweat and tears players give in return.

00:19:07.900 --> 00:19:13.070
Those who do not bring out enough strength are defeated and let out tears of regret.

00:19:13.070 --> 00:19:16.340
That is in no way meant to be equal.

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:20.200
It is the shocking, painful truth.

00:19:20.530 --> 00:19:26.650
But by clashing these emotions against one another, the depths of our youths' hearts can grow passionate.

00:19:26.650 --> 00:19:34.520
That passion will become the courage that will carry all of our young ones on throughout their long lives.

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:39.360
I declare Fifth Sector to be dissolved as of today.

00:19:41.420 --> 00:19:44.560
To all who love soccer...

00:19:44.790 --> 00:19:48.230
Please play soccer as freely as you like.

00:19:52.510 --> 00:19:53.290
Endou.

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:56.220
Thanks, Gouenji.

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:58.630
For bringing back soccer.

00:19:59.620 --> 00:20:01.340
You were the one who brought it back.

00:20:02.170 --> 00:20:03.790
I wonder about that.

00:20:03.790 --> 00:20:08.330
I know all about how you made sure schools weren't destroyed because of soccer,

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:13.050
by setting up soccer education systems and support foundations.

00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:18.750
And you were the one who started this revolution.

00:20:18.750 --> 00:20:20.600
Even though you're always late.

00:20:22.590 --> 00:20:26.070
Gouenji, let's play soccer together again.

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:27.660
Yeah.

00:20:28.350 --> 00:20:30.330
The day has finally come!

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:32.540
We did it!

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:34.760
It wasn't us.

00:20:34.760 --> 00:20:37.170
The ones to accomplish this revolution...

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:39.880
The real heroes here are those guys.

00:20:41.070 --> 00:20:46.890
They deserve the credit for truly wishing to bring back real soccer and fighting so hard for it.

00:20:47.860 --> 00:20:51.020
I think I've come to understand it a bit.

00:20:52.540 --> 00:20:55.390
What Avatars and hissatsu techniques are.

00:20:56.410 --> 00:21:02.230
Avatars and hissatsu techniques are our love for soccer packed into these shapes.

00:21:02.630 --> 00:21:06.380
I think we won because our feelings for it were greater.

00:21:07.580 --> 00:21:08.540
Maybe so.

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:15.690
I wonder if soccer was watching us.

00:22:53.870 --> 00:22:56.080
Has soccer changed?

00:22:56.080 --> 00:23:00.200
One day after the fight finished, I met that person once again.

00:23:00.200 --> 00:23:03.880
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 The Pass Towards Tomorrow

00:23:03.880 --> 00:23:05.650
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.020 --> 00:23:17.830
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:23:22.460 --> 00:23:26.120
Soccer is always watching over us!

00:23:26.120 --> 00:23:26.910
That's all!
